  "published": "2026-03-23T09:48:47.75Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.3\n\n\t\t\t- **Enhancement:** Added `ClaimsPrincipalExtensions.GetUserId()` to simplify extracting the user ID from JWT claims.\n\t\t\t- **Enhancement:** Updated `AuthorizationFilter` to use the new extension method, allowing optional fallback to the `AuthorizeResourceAttribute.UserId` if the claim is missing.\n\t\t\t- **Enhancement:** Added support for `AuthorizeResourceAttribute.CustomAction` to allow defining custom action strings (e.g., \"can_delegate\").\n\t\t\t- **Improvement:** User ID and action resolution are more robust and flexible, supporting enum, custom action, and HTTP method-based defaults.\n\t\t\t- **Refactor:** Cleaner and more maintainable authorization filter logic, with automatic inference of `ResourceType` from `ResourceId` if not explicitly set.\n\t\t\t- **Backwards Compatible:** Existing usage with `AuthorizeResourceAttribute.UserId` and enum `Action` continues to work.",
